<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Friday 105,000 - USDA. [corrected 17:58 gmt]</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Friday 105,000 - USDA. [corrected 17:58 gmt]</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Friday's est receipts 105,000, Wk ago 39,000, Yr ago 87,000. Saturday's 25,000, 26,000, and 49,000 head. Estimates include generally about 60 percent Carcass Base Hogs. Barrows and gilts were $0.50 (corrects from &quot;$1.00&quot;) higher than mid-session Thursday. Trade was slow for good demand and very light offerings. Weather conditions curtail movement in Northern area. Top $55.50 per cwt.</p>
